// Ch15: a child after the pyre-raft (Tobin). The question nobody on the raft can answer.
title: ch15_bark_raft_child
location: ch17/hollowmere
---
<<if $ch15_pyre_raft>>
    Child [sad]: We watched the fire go out on the water. Mam says the man on it was brave. Was he? #line:ch15_bark_rchild_001
<<else>>
    Child [laugh]: You can walk the whole city without touching water. I've done it. Twice. #line:ch15_bark_rchild_002
<<endif>>
